sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Студент<br/>(браузер)
    participant F as Frontend<br/>React + Monaco
    participant T as task-resolver
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Apache Kafka
    participant W as worker
    participant S as sandbox<br/>(Docker)
    participant A as ai-analyzer
    participant G as GigaChat API

    U->>F: Нажатие «Отправить»
    F->>T: POST /api/v1/submissions<br/>{taskId, code, language}
    T->>DB: INSERT submissions<br/>status=PENDING
    T->>K: publish task.submitted
    T-->>F: 202 Accepted<br/>{submissionId}
    F->>F: Запуск polling

    K->>W: consume task.submitted
    W->>DB: UPDATE status=PROCESSING
    W->>S: запуск Docker-контейнера<br/>с hardening-флагами

    loop по тестовым случаям
        S->>S: docker run<br/>--network=none<br/>--read-only
        S-->>W: SandboxExecutionResult<br/>(verdict, time, memory)
    end

    W->>A: analyze(code, language,<br/>sandboxResults)
    A->>A: AST-извлечение фактов
    A->>G: POST /chat/completions<br/>{user-prompt, system-prompt}
    G-->>A: JSON-ответ
    A->>A: JSON-Schema валидация
    A->>A: применение dynamicQualityCap
    A-->>W: AIAnalysisResult<br/>(quality, complexity, explanation)

    W->>DB: INSERT task_results, ai_analysis
    W->>DB: UPDATE status=COMPLETED
    W->>K: publish task.completed

    F->>T: GET /api/v1/submissions/{id}<br/>(каждую секунду)
    T->>DB: SELECT *
    T-->>F: {status: COMPLETED,<br/>verdict, aiAnalysis}
    F-->>U: Экран результатов
